2026-11-17T21:06:06.461Z"},{"id":3,"q":"Own competition domain (e.g. nvic.ge) or NVU subdomain (nvu.edu.ge/nvic)?","detail":"Decides hosting, email, branding and data ownership. Blocks website build.","asked_by":"Nata","category":"Website","status":"open","created_at":"2026-11-17T21:06:06.461Z"},{"id":2,"q":"Which prizes and scholarship benefits can be publicly promised at launch?","detail":"Only approved commitments may appear in public materials. Everything else stays generic (\"educational opportunities\").","asked_by":"Nata","category":"Finance & Prizes","status":"open","created_at":"2026-11-17T21:06:06.461Z"},{"id":1,"q":"What are the exact titles and decision authority of the organizing committee roles?","detail":"Formalize internally so tasks are never left unassigned while both sides assume the other is handling them.","asked_by":"Nata","category":"Governance","status":"open","created_at":"2026-11-17T21:06:06.461Z"}],"answers":[],"sponsors":[],"people":[{"id":1,"name":"Nata","role":"Co-founder · Competition methodology & coordination","org":"NVIC founding team","email":"","phone":"","note":""},{"id":2,"name":"Anri","role":"Co-founder · Competition methodology & coordination","org":"NVIC founding team","email":"","phone":"","note":""}],"responsibilities":[{"id":1,"func":"Institutional authority and official approvals","lead":"NVU management","note":""},{"id":2,"func":"Competition concept, regulations and methodology","lead":"Nata & Anri, with NVU approval","note":""},{"id":3,"func":"Website, registration and technical systems","lead":"Technical team","note":""},{"id":4,"func":"Academic quality and disciplinary guidance","lead":"NVU academic representatives","note":""},{"id":5,"func":"Jury recruitment and oversight","lead":"Joint academic committee","note":""},{"id":6,"func":"School outreach","lead":"NVU communications + organizing team","note":""},{"id":7,"func":"Project mentorship","lead":"NVU faculty and approved external experts","note":""},{"id":8,"func":"Sponsorships, funding and procurement","lead":"NVU / designated partnership lead","note":""},{"id":9,"func":"Final exhibition and awards","lead":"Joint organizing team","note":""},{"id":10,"func":"Legal, privacy and scholarship approval","lead":"NVU authorized departments","note":""}],"events":[{"id":1,"title":"Public announcement & registration opens","date":"2026-11-30","label":"November 30, 2026","phase":"launch","note":"The single fixed date. Everything essential must be live."},{"id":2,"title":"Application deadline","date":"2027-01-15","label":"January 15, 2027","phase":"competition","note":"Applications close 23:59 Tbilisi time."},{"id":3,"title":"Preliminary evaluation","date":"2027-01-16","label":"January 16–22, 2027","phase":"competition","note":"Remote evaluation by qualified reviewers."},{"id":4,"title":"Semifinalist announcement","date":"2027-01-22","label":"January 22, 2027","phase":"competition","note":"~24 projects advance."},{"id":5,"title":"Online semifinals","date":"2027-01-30","label":"January 30–31, 2027","phase":"competition","note":"5 min presentation + 5 min Q&A per team. ~12 advance."},{"id":6,"title":"Finalist development & mentorship","date":"2027-02-01","label":"February 1 – March 12, 2027","phase":"competition","note":"Structured mentorship period."},{"id":7,"title":"National Final & Awards Ceremony","date":"2027-03-20","label":"March 20, 2027","phase":"final","note":"Final exhibition + defense + awards at New Vision University, Tbilisi."}],"notes":[{"id":3,"body":"First document for formal NVU approval: the Competition Regulations (კონკურსის დებულება). Website, school announcements and the application form must all use exactly the same approved rules.","by_":"Nata","created_at":"2026-11-17T21:06:06.461Z"},{"id":2,"body":"Priority order: Nov 17–20 lock rules & institutional decisions → Nov 21–26 build application infrastructure → Nov 27–30 test, approve, launch.","by_":"Nata","created_at":"2026-11-17T21:06:06.461Z"},{"id":1,"body":"Launch principle: do NOT delay November 30 for exhibition design, promotional video or trophy designs. What must be complete on launch day: the legal & academic foundation, accurate public information, a functioning application process, and credible commitments from the organizer.","by_":"Nata","created_at":"2026-11-17T21:06:06.461Z"}],"activity":[{"id":1,"actor":"system","action":"created","target":"NVIC Command Center initialized with 89 tasks, 12 documents, calendar & roles","created_at":"2026-11-17T21:06:06.461Z"}]}